  "6002": "Interactive mode",
  "6003": "Interactive mode",
  "6004": "This only works outside mems-rosco.",
  "6005": "Open Command Prompt or PowerShell and change to the folder containing readmems, e.g. c:\\mems-roscobin.",
  "6006": "You can check this by typing \"dir\" or \".dir\".",
  "6007": "<html><head/><body><p>Open interactive mode by entering &quot;readmems com3 interactive&quot;, or in PowerShell &quot;.readmems com3 interactive&quot;.</p></body></html>",
  "6008": "com is the port your interface is connected to!",
  "6009": "<html><head/><body><p><span style=\" font-size:12pt; color:#ff0000;\">Only do this if you know Colin's command list well.</span></p><p><span style=\" font-size:12pt; color:#ff0000;\">Proceed at your own risk!</span></p></body></html>",
  "6010": "<html><head/><body><p>&quot;0xFA&quot; destroys all your settings!</p></body></html>",
